                                    <TextBlock Text="v1.2.0 新特性与架构亮点" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1E293B" Margin="0,0,0,10"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="• 【五维分类架构重构】将设置面板重组为触发与场景、外观与形态、手势与动作、高级与系统、关于与更新五个清晰心智分区。" FontSize="12" Foreground="#334155" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="• 【五大轮盘形态与光学切缝】支持蜂巢六边形矩阵、独立圆形卡片、悬浮胶囊与圆角切削，配备 0~12px 缝隙与倒角调节。" FontSize="12" Foreground="#334155" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="• 【四层统一矢量图标引擎】内置 30+ 常用矢量图标库与可视化选择器，支持图文双行/纯图标/纯文字三种排版模式。" FontSize="12" Foreground="#334155" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="• 【所见即所得 60FPS 实时画布】在外观设置中嵌入实时轮盘预览，支持鼠标划过测试磁吸手感与高亮动效。" FontSize="12" Foreground="#334155" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="• 【配置备份与导入导出】支持将全部动作、配色与几何设置一键导出为 JSON 备份文件，方便多设备迁移。" FontSize="12" Foreground="#334155"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Border>

                            <!-- Card 3: Version Milestones -->
                            <Border Background="White" BorderBrush="#E2E8F0" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="20" Margin="0,0,0,14">
                                <Border.Effect>
                                    <DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="12" ShadowDepth="1" Color="#000000" Opacity="0.03"/>
                                </Border.Effect>
                                <StackPanel>
                                    <TextBlock Text="版本演进里程碑 (Milestones)" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1E293B" Margin="0,0,0,14"/>
                                    
                                    <!-- v1.2.0 -->
                                    <Border BorderBrush="#E2E8F0" BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Padding="0,0,0,10" Margin="0,0,0,10">
                                        <Grid>
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="90"/>
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <Border Background="#EFF6FF" CornerRadius="4" Padding="6,2" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top">
                                                <TextBlock Text="v1.2.0" FontWeight="Bold" Foreground="#2563EB" FontSize="11"/>
                                            </Border>
                                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="8,0,0,0">
                                                <TextBlock Text="五维分区重构 &amp; 五大轮盘形态 &amp; 矢量图标引擎 &amp; 实时画布" FontWeight="Medium" Foreground="#0F172A" FontSize="12"/>
                                                <TextBlock Text="重构设置架构，加入60FPS实时交互画布，支持蜂巢六边形等五大形态、30+矢量图标与配置备份还原。" Foreground="#64748B" FontSize="11" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                                            </StackPanel>
                                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="2026-08-19" FontSize="11" Foreground="#94A3B8" HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Top"/>
                                        </Grid>
                                    </Border>
                                    
                                    <!-- v1.1.0 -->
                                    <Border BorderBrush="#E2E8F0" BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Padding="0,0,0,10" Margin="0,0,0,10">
                                        <Grid>
                                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                                <ColumnDefinition Width="90"/>
                                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <Border Background="#F1F5F9" CornerRadius="4" Padding="6,2" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Top">
                                                <TextBlock Text="v1.1.0" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#475569" FontSize="11"/>
